        "created_at": "2017-12-02T05:01:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Is there another glitch that prevents this unlock? &nbsp;I have tried repeatedly without success, following the official conditions and even avoiding the glitch conditions mentioned above.</p><p>I’ve tried vs Gloomweaver and Ambuscade in Final Wasteland, with TL Tachyon, Legacy (regular or Greatest), Hakka, and Argent Adept (regular or XPW).</p><p>Maybe the 20 damage has to be unboosted?</p>",
