        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-06T15:52:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We've identified the problem with the unlock condition - it's a new bug unfortunately introduced when fixing another bug with it. We are working on an update with a fix. Until then you can unlock the variant by clicking the lock icon then the unlock button. That will let you play the variant, but won't prevent you from performing the story challenge and earning the achievement later.</p>",
