        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We've identified the problem with the unlock condition - it's a new bug unfortunately introduced when fixing another bug with it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This, friends, is one of the reasons I decided not to become a programmer ;-)&nbsp; Hats off to you guys who enjoy it!</p>\n<p>After I submitted a bug report by email, I received a reply asking for more details on what I did, but haven't had a chance to respond.&nbsp; Is it still helpful for me to do so?</p>",
