        "created_at": "2017-12-06T18:27:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"gossamerica2\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/51bf81/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> gossamerica2:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>After I submitted a bug report by email, I received a reply asking for more details on what I did, but haven't had a chance to respond.&nbsp; Is it still helpful for me to do so?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Thanks! No need for more info, we're figured it out and will get it into the next update.</p>",
